# sManager Complete User Journey - Registration to Advanced Business Verification

## Overview
This documentation covers the complete user journey from initial app registration, login, KYC verification, to achieving advanced business verification (Merchant Type C) in the sManager application. Each step includes detailed cURL commands using production URLs.

## Production Base URLs
- **API Gateway**: `https://api-gateway.shebapay.xyz:4443/`
- **ShebaPayBaseUrl**: `https://api-gateway.shebapay.xyz:4443/gateway/sapi/`
- **Middleware**: `https://api-gateway.shebapay.xyz:4443/gateway/`
- **Sheba Manager**: `https://sapi.shebapay.xyz:4052/`

## Merchant Types
- **Type A**: Basic Account (No KYC)
- **Type B**: KYC Verified (isKycVerified = 1)
- **Type C**: Advanced Business Verified (isAdvanceBusinessInfoVerified = 1)

