  "https://api-gateway.shebapay.xyz:4443/gateway/sapi/registration/location/district" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {access_token}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "districtId": 1
  }'
```

#### Step 3.3: Upload Business Images

**Upload Shop Image (for Offline/Hybrid Business):**
