### Status 1: Advanced Business Verified (Type C Merchant)

User has achieved the highest verification level. All features are unlocked.

### Status 2: Processing

**Monitor Status:**
```bash
curl -X GET \
  "https://api-gateway.shebapay.xyz:4443/gateway/auth/v1/sheba-pay/user_app_config" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {access_token}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json"
```

### Status 3: Rejected

Return to Step 3.1 and restart advanced business verification with corrected information.

